@startuml
title Farm Management System State Diagram

state "User Not Logged In" as UserNotLoggedIn
state "Main Area" as MainArea
state "Market Conditions" as MarketConditions
state "Market Report" as MarketReport
state "Pest Control Help" as PestControlHelp
state "Pest Control Techniques" as PestControlTechniques
state "Soil Information" as SoilInformation
state "Weather Insights" as WeatherInsights
state "Labour Availability Details" as LabourAvailabilityDetails
state "Session Active" as SessionActive
state "User Logged Out" as UserLoggedOut

UserNotLoggedIn --> [*] : user attempts login
MainArea --> MarketConditions : user selects market conditions
MarketConditions --> MarketReport : user views report
MainArea --> PestControlHelp : user selects pest control help
PestControlHelp --> PestControlTechniques : user provides photo
PestControlHelp --> PestControlTechniques : system requests photo
SoilInformation --> SoilRelatedSuggestions : soil information received
MainArea --> WeatherInsights : user selects weather insights
MainArea --> LabourAvailabilityDetails : user selects labour availability details
SessionActive --> SessionActive : user continues using service
UserLoggedIn --> UserNotLoggedIn : user logs out
@enduml
